  "id": "zagara",
  "name": "Zagara",
  "role": "Ranged Assassin",
  "overview": "Zagara is a Ranged Assassin who relies on Zerg summons to wreak havoc on her opponents. Creep Tumor is a strong ability, providing not only buffs to several of her attributes, including attack range and movement speed, but also supplying precious vision throughout the Battleground. Zagara is capable of tearing down enemy defenses from afar and, when left alone for even a small duration, will turn the strongest enemy fortifications into nothing more than heaps of rubble.",
  "strengths": [
    "Excellent long range, sustain damage",
    "Great waveclear",
    "Strong sieging power",
    "Creep Tumor provides a massive amount of vision throughout the entire battlefield",
    "Able to solo Mercenary Camps with ease"
  ],
  "weaknesses": [
    "Quite vulnerable to crowd control",
    "Zero mobility, except on Creep",
    "Mana hungry",
    "Low burst damage",
    "Her only form of hard crowd control is Devouring Maw"
  ],
