    "explanation": "Zagara is particularly good on larger Maps with multiple Objective locations (such as Sky Temple), when she can take advantage of distracted enemy Heroes to split-push uncontested, sometimes even with the help of Nydus Network.\n\nMaps that are smaller (such as Tomb of the Spider Queen) make it much more difficult for Zagara to split-push. In those situations, Zagara can still be a great lane bully in the early game and a powerful damage dealer in the late game, thanks to Talents."
